/**
 * Computes the minimal separators of {@code e} in the neighborhood of {@code e} in {@code graph}.
 * More precisely, for every pair of vertices $u, v$ connected by $e_uv \in E(G)$, computes the minimal set of vertices $S_{euv} \subseteq V(G)$ such that $e$ can be deleted without disconnecting $u$ and $v$.
 * @param e the edge whose minimal separators to compute
